# Trial script for picking the dialogue tool (M0). Placeholder writing:
# the real move-in, date and scene scripts are written in M5.

~ move_in

Onsen keeper: So this is the house you picked for me.
if villager_happy
	Onsen keeper: Close enough to the spring that I can hear it. You did well.
else
	Onsen keeper: It's a little far from the water. I'll manage... for now.
Onsen keeper: Come by the bath sometime. Bring a towel.
- I'll be there.
	set affection += 1
	Onsen keeper: Good. I'll keep it warm.
- Maybe after the next delve.
	Onsen keeper: Then don't keep me waiting too long.
=> END

~ date_teaser

if content_level >= 1
	Onsen keeper: [i]This line only shows at Suggestive or above.[/i]
else
	Onsen keeper: [i]This line shows in the SFW build.[/i]
=> END
